+### Command line
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar` without arguments to list all commands, or `<command> -help` for the options of one command.
+* `analyzeLandscape` creates or updates a landscape report aggregating the analyses found under an analysis root (`-analysisRoot <folder>`), the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands. `updateLandscape` is the same command under its older name.
